WEBVTT

00:07.793 --> 00:08.965
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.034 --> 00:10.586
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.655 --> 00:12.068
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.137 --> 00:14.034
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.103 --> 00:16.896
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:16.965 --> 00:19.172
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.241 --> 00:21.000
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.068 --> 00:23.034
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.103 --> 00:24.758
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.827 --> 00:27.068
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.137 --> 00:28.862
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:28.931 --> 00:31.137
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.206 --> 00:33.379
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.448 --> 00:35.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.275 --> 00:37.379
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.448 --> 00:39.103
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.172 --> 00:40.620
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.689 --> 00:42.482
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.551 --> 00:45.034
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.103 --> 00:47.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:51.655 --> 00:54.551
[peaceful music]
[平静的音乐]

00:54.620 --> 01:01.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.379 --> 01:03.586
- ♪ La-la-la-la-la-
la-la-la-la ♪
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦-
啦啦啦啦♪

01:03.655 --> 01:05.482
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:05.551 --> 01:07.517
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:07.586 --> 01:09.310
♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:09.379 --> 01:11.310
♪ La-la-la-la--♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦——♪

01:11.379 --> 01:13.655
all: Ahh!
全体：啊！

01:13.724 --> 01:17.000
- ♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la ♪
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:17.068 --> 01:21.517
♪ La-la, la-la-la-la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦♪

01:22.206 --> 01:26.000
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:26.068 --> 01:28.896
- You know that child
we were planning on having?
- 你认识那个孩子
我们计划有什么？

01:28.965 --> 01:30.931
both: Let's forget it.
两人：算了吧。

01:31.000 --> 01:35.689
- ♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-laaa ♪
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦♪

01:35.758 --> 01:41.862
- Ah! SpongeBob, I could hear
you caterwauling a mile away.
- 啊！海绵宝宝，我听见了
你在一英里外嚎叫。

01:41.931 --> 01:43.965
- Aw, thanks,
and thanks for watching
- 噢，谢谢，
感谢您的观看

01:44.034 --> 01:46.896
my Sea Chimps
while I'm at work.
我的海黑猩猩
当我在工作的时候。

01:46.965 --> 01:49.137
- They're already
in an aquarium.
- 他们已经
在水族馆里。

01:49.206 --> 01:51.172
Why don't you just
leave 'em at home?
你为什么不直接
把他们留在家里？

01:51.241 --> 01:52.896
- Hm.
- 嗯。

01:52.965 --> 01:55.896
I think Gary might be
trying to eat them.
我认为加里可能是
试图吃掉它们。

01:55.965 --> 01:59.137
I found saliva on the glass.
我在玻璃上发现了口水。

01:59.206 --> 02:01.206
- So what do I need
to do for them?
- 那么我需要什么
为他们做什么？

02:01.275 --> 02:03.103
- Nothing! They'll
take care of themselves.
- 没有什么！他们会
照顾好自己。

02:03.172 --> 02:05.620
Oh? Hm!
Well, I got to go.
哦？嗯！
好吧，我得走了。

02:05.689 --> 02:08.310
Here's my breeze.
Whoa-ow-ow-ow!
这是我的微风。
哇哦哦！

02:09.689 --> 02:13.724
- When will you ever learn
that a tiny pipsqueak like you
- 你什么时候才能学会
像你这样的小家伙

02:13.793 --> 02:17.689
will never, ever,
take over anything.
永远、永远、
接管任何事情。

02:18.862 --> 02:21.689
What do you call this
gizmo you made anyway?
你管这个叫什么
你还是做了小发明吗？

02:21.758 --> 02:24.344
[mechanical rattling]
[机械嘎嘎声]

02:24.413 --> 02:26.862
- [coughing]
- [咳嗽]

02:26.931 --> 02:29.724
The Takeover-er-er.
接管-呃-呃。

02:29.793 --> 02:33.724
- [laughing]
That's just stupid.
- [笑]
那太愚蠢了。

02:33.793 --> 02:37.413
[whooshing]
[呼啸]

02:37.482 --> 02:39.793
- Morning.
- Morning...
- 早晨。
- 早晨...

02:39.862 --> 02:43.137
- And don't forget
your Rube Goldfish device!
- 别忘了
你的鲁布金鱼设备！

02:43.206 --> 02:46.241
[whirling]
There we go.
[旋转]
我们开始吧。

02:47.275 --> 02:48.862
- Ah!
- 啊！

02:50.793 --> 02:53.103
Ahhh!
啊啊！

02:53.172 --> 02:54.620
[crashing]
[崩溃]

02:54.689 --> 02:56.758
[pained grunting]
[痛苦的咕哝]

02:56.827 --> 02:58.068
[sighing]
[叹气]

02:58.137 --> 02:59.413
[cracking]
[开裂]

02:59.482 --> 03:02.448
Honey, I'm home.
亲爱的，我回来了。

03:02.517 --> 03:04.655
What's this stupid thing?
这是什么蠢事？

03:04.724 --> 03:06.689
- Those are
SpongeBob's Sea Chimps.
- 那些是
海绵宝宝的海黑猩猩。

03:06.758 --> 03:08.172
You don't need
to bother with them.
你不需要
去打扰他们。

03:08.241 --> 03:10.000
I'm going back
to my shows now.
我要回去了
现在开始我的表演。

03:10.068 --> 03:11.413
- Uh!
- Oh!
- 呃！
- 哦！

03:11.482 --> 03:13.206
- Uh!
- Ah!
- 呃！
- 啊！

03:13.275 --> 03:14.517
- Oh! Ah.
- 哦！啊。

03:14.586 --> 03:15.862
- Hmm. Huh?
- 唔。啊？

03:15.931 --> 03:18.034
Sea Chimps, huh?
海黑猩猩，是吗？

03:19.172 --> 03:23.103
all: ♪ La-la-la-la-
la-la-la-la-la-la ♪
全体：♪ 啦啦啦啦-
啦啦啦啦啦啦♪

03:23.172 --> 03:27.275
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦♪

03:27.344 --> 03:28.758
- Wait a minute.
- 等一下。

03:28.827 --> 03:29.965
Maybe I've been
going about this
也许我曾经
正在做这件事

03:30.034 --> 03:32.172
world conquest thing
all wrong.
征服世界的事
都错了。

03:32.241 --> 03:36.758
Maybe I should start small
and work my way up!
也许我应该从小事做起
并努力向上！

03:36.827 --> 03:39.827
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

03:41.793 --> 03:43.620
This shrink belt will allow me
这条收缩带可以让我

03:43.689 --> 03:46.241
to walk among
those little monkeys.
行走其中
那些小猴子。

03:46.310 --> 03:48.137
Alley-oop!
空中接力！

03:51.896 --> 03:54.000
[laughing]
[笑]

03:56.310 --> 03:58.241
Ah!
啊!

03:59.793 --> 04:01.931
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

04:02.000 --> 04:04.413
Too small, too small!
太小了，太小了！

04:08.103 --> 04:11.517
Huh? [mumbling]
啊？ [咕哝]

04:13.827 --> 04:16.965
Hey, why are you idiots
so short?
嘿，你们为什么是白痴
这么短？

04:18.931 --> 04:20.448
You afraid of me?
你怕我吗？

04:20.517 --> 04:22.344
You gonna cry?
你会哭吗？

04:23.344 --> 04:24.068
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

04:24.137 --> 04:27.344
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

04:29.206 --> 04:32.413
Listen here,
you pint sized twerps.
听这里，
你们这些小傻瓜。

04:32.482 --> 04:35.793
I'm taking over
your monkey town, see?
我来接手
你的猴城，看到了吗？

04:35.862 --> 04:37.620
[nervous murmuring]
[紧张的低语]

04:37.689 --> 04:41.482
Do you little cretins have
a king or a queen or something?
你们这些小白痴有吗
国王或王后什么的？

04:41.551 --> 04:44.586
- Um, I am the king.
- 嗯，我是国王。

04:44.655 --> 04:47.862
- Yeah? Well now I'm the king!
- 是的？好吧，现在我是国王了！

04:47.931 --> 04:50.931
- Wow, thank you, sir!
I mean, sire.
- 哇，谢谢你，先生！
我是说，陛下。

04:51.000 --> 04:54.000
I'm not the king!
I'm not the king!
我不是国王！
我不是国王！

04:54.068 --> 04:58.000
I'm not the king!
I'm not the king-ing-ing!
我不是国王！
我不是王者！

04:58.068 --> 05:00.103
- Why was that so easy?
- 为什么这么容易？

05:00.172 --> 05:03.586
It's so easy
because I'm so big and smart!
就是这么简单
因为我又大又聪明！

05:03.655 --> 05:05.413
That's why!
这就是为什么！

05:05.482 --> 05:07.931
Ah!
啊!

05:08.000 --> 05:10.862
Well,
what are you all waiting for?
嗯，
你们还在等什么？

05:10.931 --> 05:13.413
Follow your leader!
Fall!
跟随你的领导！
落下！

05:13.482 --> 05:15.482
[all whimper]
[全都呜咽]

05:16.827 --> 05:19.586
[trumpeting]
[喇叭声]

05:19.655 --> 05:24.103
That's right,
bring me all your valuables.
没错，
把你所有的贵重物品都给我带来。

05:27.241 --> 05:31.000
What are those?
Dentures? Hand them over.
那些是什么？
假牙？把它们交给我。

05:32.862 --> 05:35.034
That's more like it.
这更像是这样。

05:35.103 --> 05:38.344
I want to be the only one
in town with stuff!
我想成为唯一的一个
在城里带着东西！

05:38.413 --> 05:40.000
Ah!
啊!

05:40.724 --> 05:41.965
all: Ah!
众人：啊！

05:42.034 --> 05:45.896
- I'm tired of walking.
Carry me!
- 我走累了。
带我吧！

05:51.034 --> 05:53.206
- Ah!
- Father!
- 啊！
- 父亲！

05:54.517 --> 05:58.172
- [laughing] Right in the head!
You guys are idiots.
- [笑]就在脑子里！
你们都是白痴。

05:58.241 --> 06:02.000
I'm the smart one.
I've got the best ideas.
我是最聪明的那个
我有最好的主意。

06:02.068 --> 06:05.000
Hey, you!
Here's a grape-flavored idea!
嘿，你！
这是一个葡萄味的主意！

06:05.068 --> 06:06.103
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

06:06.172 --> 06:08.137
- Oh!
- Ah!
- 哦！
- 啊！

06:08.206 --> 06:10.103
- [whimpering]
Ah!
- [呜咽]
啊！

06:10.172 --> 06:13.103
- Okay, that's enough.
I'm bored.
- 好吧，够了。
我很无聊。

06:13.172 --> 06:15.413
[engine revving]
[发动机转速]

06:15.482 --> 06:17.103
Yeah!
是的！

06:17.172 --> 06:20.172
I rule you,
I rule you, I rule you.
我统治你，
我统治你，我统治你。

06:20.241 --> 06:24.344
I rule you, you, you,
and you--Ah!
我统治你，你，你，
而你——啊！

06:24.413 --> 06:27.034
Ahh! Ow!
啊！噢！

06:29.724 --> 06:31.344
Ta-da!
哒哒！

06:31.413 --> 06:33.310
Piggyback for the king!
为国王背驮！

06:33.379 --> 06:36.379
Let's see how fast
this old lady can go.
让我们看看有多快
这位老太太可以走了。

06:36.448 --> 06:37.793
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

06:37.862 --> 06:40.586
- [yowling]
- [嚎叫]

06:40.655 --> 06:42.241
- Yee-ha!
- 耶哈！

06:42.310 --> 06:45.551
Today, Sea Chimps,
tomorrow, the world!
今天，海黑猩猩，
明天，世界！

06:48.689 --> 06:54.379
I rule you, I rule you,
and I rule...you...
我统治你，我统治你，
我统治...你...

06:54.448 --> 06:55.896
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:55.965 --> 06:58.068
[screeching]
[尖叫声]

06:58.137 --> 07:00.758
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:00.827 --> 07:04.000
Hey, what is this?
嘿，这是什么？

07:04.068 --> 07:05.551
Where am I?
我在哪里？

07:05.620 --> 07:07.034
Okay, ha-ha.
好吧，哈哈。

07:07.103 --> 07:08.482
Very humorous.
非常幽默。

07:08.551 --> 07:09.586
Having a bit of fun
玩得开心

07:09.655 --> 07:13.137
with the king,
[chuckles] I get it.
与国王，
[笑]我明白了。

07:13.206 --> 07:17.000
I think my armpits are dry now.
You can cut me down.
我觉得我的腋窝现在很干燥。
你可以砍倒我。

07:17.068 --> 07:19.068
[laughing awkwardly]
[尴尬地笑]

07:19.137 --> 07:21.586
I demand you obey your king!
我要求你服从你的国王！

07:21.655 --> 07:25.137
Let's go!
Come on you little bozos!
我们走吧！
加油你们这些小笨蛋！

07:25.206 --> 07:27.034
Get me down!
给我下来！

07:27.103 --> 07:31.310
Guys?
My people? Loyal subjects?
伙计们？
我的人？忠诚的臣民？

07:31.379 --> 07:34.172
[gulping]
Buddies?
[吞咽]
哥们？

07:34.241 --> 07:36.413
- Oh! Hello! Remember me?
- 哦！你好！记住账号？

07:36.482 --> 07:38.724
You took my crown
and became the new king?
你夺走了我的皇冠
并成为新国王？

07:38.793 --> 07:40.620
I just wanted to say
thanks again.
我只是想说
再次感谢。

07:40.689 --> 07:44.206
Oh, and, uh,
have a nice sacrifice!
哦，还有，呃，
有一个美好的牺牲！

07:44.275 --> 07:45.965
- Sacrifice?
- 牺牲？

07:46.034 --> 07:50.344
[all chanting "Tongue"]
[所有人都高呼“舌头”]

07:50.413 --> 07:53.206
- Tongue?
That's a weird request.
- 舌头？
这是一个奇怪的要求。

07:53.275 --> 07:56.241
But as king I'll be benevolent.
但作为国王我会仁慈的。

07:58.655 --> 08:02.931
Gah!
What in Neptune's naval...?
嘎！
海王星的海军里有什么……？

08:03.000 --> 08:07.275
[all chanting "Tongue"]
[所有人都高呼“舌头”]

08:10.517 --> 08:12.862
Hey! Whoa!
嘿！哇！

08:14.344 --> 08:18.586
Yuck! Time to un-shrink!
哎呀！是时候不收缩了！

08:18.655 --> 08:23.379
Can't...reach...I take it back.
I don't want to be king!
无法...到达...我收回它。
我不想当国王！

08:23.448 --> 08:26.724
- Uh-uh-uh.
No takee-backsees.
- 呃呃呃。
没有后顾之忧。

08:30.413 --> 08:33.620
all: Aww.
- What do you mean, "aww"?
全体：哇。
- 你是什么意思，“哇”？

08:33.689 --> 08:34.965
Don't aww!
别啊哇！

08:35.034 --> 08:39.517
- Ow! That hurt.
- 噢！那很痛。

08:39.586 --> 08:45.103
[laughing]
Now that snack's got a bite.
[笑]
现在那零食已经咬了一口了。

08:46.862 --> 08:50.448
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:51.620 --> 08:53.586
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

09:00.034 --> 09:02.172
- Oh, don't worry, sire!
- 哦，别担心，陛下！

09:02.241 --> 09:04.758
I will cut you loose
from the sacrifice.
我会放开你
来自牺牲。

09:04.827 --> 09:06.310
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

09:06.379 --> 09:09.931
- Hey, stop!
Nice old Chimp king.
- 嘿，停下来！
漂亮的老黑猩猩国王。

09:10.000 --> 09:11.620
Don't do that!
不要那样做！

09:13.000 --> 09:15.172
Ahh!
啊！

09:16.448 --> 09:18.965
[Sea Chimps screaming]
[海黑猩猩尖叫]

09:19.034 --> 09:21.241
- [gulping]
- [吞咽]

09:23.310 --> 09:25.689
- How did you get over there?
- 你是怎么到那里的？

09:25.758 --> 09:28.793
[snapping]
Ahh!
[啪啪啪]
啊！

09:28.862 --> 09:31.068
- Hey, you're welcome!
- 嘿，不客气！

09:31.137 --> 09:32.482
- Hey, dumbbell.
- 嘿，哑铃。

09:32.551 --> 09:34.413
Take this end of the belt
and wrap it around
拿起皮带的这一端
并将其包裹起来

09:34.482 --> 09:35.931
all the other falling
numbskulls
所有其他的落下
麻木的头骨

09:36.000 --> 09:37.241
and bring it back to me!
把它带回来给我！

09:37.310 --> 09:40.206
It stretches.
Go!
它伸展。
去！

09:40.275 --> 09:43.310
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:43.379 --> 09:47.068
You morons should cushion
my fall nicely.
你们这些白痴应该缓冲一下
我的秋天很好。

09:48.344 --> 09:51.275
[all screaming]
[Patrick gulping]
[所有人尖叫]
[帕特里克吞咽]

09:53.137 --> 09:56.344
- [humming]
[screaming]
- [嗡嗡声]
[尖叫]

09:56.413 --> 09:58.586
Oh, Oh-oh! Patrick!
哦，哦，哦！帕特里克！

09:58.655 --> 10:02.275
It was you trying to eat
my Sea Chimps the whole time.
是你想吃东西
我的海黑猩猩一直在。

10:02.344 --> 10:04.896
- [scoffing]
- [嘲笑]

10:06.000 --> 10:12.103
I can't believe you'd accuse me
of--of--such a delicious thing.
我不敢相信你会指控我
如此美味的东西。

10:12.172 --> 10:13.689
[belches]
[打嗝]

10:13.758 --> 10:15.896
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

10:15.965 --> 10:18.724
- I hear 'em in there.
- 我听到他们在那里。

10:18.793 --> 10:21.620
- Hey, King, what's this
dialy-doodle-mojig
- 嘿，国王，这是什么？
Dialy 涂鸦 mojig

10:21.689 --> 10:25.344
on your belt do?
- No, don't touch that!
你的腰带上有什么吗？
- 不，别碰那个！

10:25.413 --> 10:29.620
- Whoa-oh-oh-oh!
- 哇哦哦！

10:31.586 --> 10:36.344
I take it back.
They weren't that delicious.
我收回它。
它们没那么好吃。

10:37.758 --> 10:42.379
- Whoa! Hey guys, come on out.
There's more room out here.
- 哇！嘿伙计们，出来吧。
这里还有更多空间。

10:42.448 --> 10:46.310
[all screeching excitedly]
[大家兴奋地尖叫]

10:48.000 --> 10:49.586
- Uhh.
- 呃。

10:49.655 --> 10:52.448
- Partially digested antennae.
- 部分消化的触角。

10:52.517 --> 10:55.793
- Welcome, Sea Chimps.
I'm SpongeBob, your owner.
- 欢迎，海黑猩猩。
我是海绵宝宝，你的主人。

10:55.862 --> 10:58.241
- Forget it, man.
We're through with owners,
- 忘了它吧，伙计。
我们已经和业主谈完了，

10:58.310 --> 11:00.517
and kings, and aquariums.
还有国王和水族馆。

11:00.586 --> 11:03.724
Whoa! Now that looks like
a swell place to live.
哇！现在看起来像
一个舒适的居住地。

11:03.793 --> 11:06.793
[all screeching]
[全都尖叫]

11:07.965 --> 11:12.206
- Ah! Plankton!
Abandon bucket!
- 啊！浮游生物！
放弃桶！

11:12.275 --> 11:14.655
- Well, that's a write off.
- 嗯，这是一笔注销。

11:15.862 --> 11:18.068
[winding]
[绕线]

11:18.137 --> 11:19.655
[Sea Chimps "Whoa!"]
[海黑猩猩“哇！”]

11:19.724 --> 11:21.965
- Bye, Sea Chimps!
Have a good flight!
- 再见，海黑猩猩！
祝您飞行愉快！

11:22.034 --> 11:24.206
That was so nice of you
to help relocate
你真是太好了
帮助搬迁

11:24.275 --> 11:26.793
the Sea Chimps, Plankton.
You rule!
海黑猩猩，浮游生物。
你统治！

11:26.862 --> 11:31.310
- Not today, SpongeBob.
Not today.
- 今天不行，海绵宝宝。
不是今天。

11:31.379 --> 11:34.965
But...someday!
但是……总有一天！

11:35.034 --> 11:38.034
[maniacal laughing]
[疯狂的大笑]

11:38.103 --> 11:41.827
Oh!
- [gulping, belching]
哦！
- [吞咽，打嗝]

11:43.068 --> 11:46.931
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

11:47.000 --> 11:54.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪